      "text": "[7:29PM] #Vi #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood traffic movement from McWen Bridge, inward and outward bound to Bonny Camp Roundabout.\nAppreciable traffic flow on Ahmadu Bello Way, en route Eko Hotel and return.\nUncongested traffic from Bonny Camp Underbridge, en route Kofo Abayomi, Oniru Kilimajaro, and down to Ozumba stretch, with the exception of minor delays at traffic light intersections.\nSteady traffic movement on the stretch from Law School to Civic Center, BJ1004, School Corner to Sand Field, inward to Lekki Phase 1, and return, with some delays at traffic light intersections and alternation points.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
